WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.940
Whatcha doin', Minami?

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.150
I'm working out an equation for achieving a SoLaMi SMILE victory.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.400
An equation for victory?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.820
Just one month to Last ParaPri.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:19.960
There's Falulu of course, and Dressing Pafé just got those new Cyalume coords.

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.010
We're <i>two</i> steps behind.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.290
We need to evolve somehow or we're done for.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.370
Don't give up, Minami!

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.090
Oh yeah! To help her with her calculations...

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:36.010
I'll spray this sharp mint scent to improve her focus!

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.830
Go, scent! Go go go!

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.280
What a mess...

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.520
My head's about to do a somersault.

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.420
Somersault?

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.230
Oh! How about we do somersaults?

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.700
So, I was watching PriPara TV yesterday...

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.260
And they did a somersault in a dance!

00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:59.590
Think we should try that too?

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:00.910
Kyupikon!

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.990
Somersault...

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.000
I bet we could...

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:06.830
Capisce!

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:07.910
Gotcha!

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.960
...do even crazier stuff!

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.670
Worth trying value...

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:15.880
73 percent. More than enough!

00:01:16.710 --> 00:01:19.390
Somer... sault?

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:23.740
Don't worry, Lala and I can handle that part.

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:27.010
You just keep up your usual perfect dancing.

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:27.980
I want to try.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.080
I want to do a somersault too.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:13.710
What? You want to do a somersault on stage-kuma?

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:14.840
Yeah!

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.420
You serious-kuma?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.230
Pripri-serious-pri!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.430
And to prove that, we've started training!

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:23.890
One! Twooo...

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:27.350
Three, fooouuurrr...

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.310
Fiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiive...

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:34.590
Looks like it-kuma.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.720
Why don't you guys head on over to this-kuma?

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:38.290
What?

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:38.930
Come train with us!
PriPara Gym

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:43.490
PriPara Gym? I didn't know they had gyms in PriPara!

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:46.250
"Easy program, starting with the basics."

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.480
"Get a free PriTicket for applying now!"

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:50.830
Sounds fun.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.210
Thanks, Mr. Kuma!

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:53.940
Let's go right now!

00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:54.850
Onward, idols!

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:55.670
Pri!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:57.930
The fools...

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:01.780
They know not the cruelty and terror of PriPara Gym.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:06.110
But just as the lions throw their
beloved children into the ravine,

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.790
so must I.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:08.930
Off you go!

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.340
Forgive me-kuma! This is all for our victory-kuma!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.900
Sorry, sorry!

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.860
Is it really out here?

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.510
This is definitely pretty out of way.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.820
Oh! There it is-pri!

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.540
We're here!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.750
Hello! We're here to sign up for the PriPara Gym!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.060
Oh no, my bag!

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:54.690
Welcome to the PriPara Gym.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:05:00.650
I am the proprietor of this gym, Ookanda Gloria-glo.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:04.110
Headmistress? Why are you here?

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:10.830
I was scouted for the position after being declared the biggest PriPara fan among the teachers of the world.

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:13.440
And...

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.250
Hi!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.290
Leave the drilling to me! Love - Fifteen!

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.760
Love too?!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:30.360
Instructors Love, Rina, and myself will put you lot through the wringer-glo.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:31.970
I hope you're ready!

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:32.400
Capisce!

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:32.880
Pri!

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:33.430
Yes.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.350
Answer only with "Glo"!

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.420
Guh... Glo...

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.320
I can't hear you!

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:41.460
Glo!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:45.030
You want to perform a somersault?

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:45.950
Glo!

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.050
Show me what you can do then-glo.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:52.910
Glo! Ready, steady...

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:03.580
As I feared. Nevermind a somersault, you can't even do the basics.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.930
Instructor Love. Bring me <i>that.</i>

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:06.840
Ma'am!

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:07.770
Here.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:15.020
I anticipated this, and prepared a special pro<i>glo</i>m just for you-glo!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.240
Music, start!

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:25.670
I present to you: EZ DO Gloxercise!

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:29.070
Begin by spreading both arms and following my legs.

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:35.520
Capisce, capisce! Gotcha! Gotcha!

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.910
Pshu..

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.030
Easy peasy!

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:44.630
Making this just for us, Team Glo ain't all bad-pri!

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:48.510
Naive! The true Gloxercise hasn't even begun-glo!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:55.740
Capisce, capisce.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:57.940
I can't see ahead...

00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.970
H-Heavy...

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:02.610
Glo's just a big bully...

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.190
Breakdown!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:10.910
The finish to our Gloxercise will be breaking these roof tiles.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.590
EZ DO Lovely!

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.720
EZ DO Glo—

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.960
Utterly worthless! Outfit change!

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:26.000
No way! This looks awful!

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.460
Put your backs into it-glo!

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:31.590
Ca... Ca... Capisce!

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.430
What the heck is this?!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.330
Go... Go... gotcha...

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.390
Gold

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.970
Pshu...

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.350
Shurururu...

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:48.070
No! We can't win at ParaPri like this-pri!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.330
We might do good at a funny costume contest.

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.320
Warm.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.010
Director, we have a new applicant.

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.790
Very well. Let them through.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.150
Falulu!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.250
Capisce!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:08.800
Gotcha!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.340
Pshu...

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.000
EZ DO Glo!

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.970
EZ DO Lovely!

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.390
Incredible...

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:26.190
L-L-L-Lovely!

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.770
A splendid display of Gloxercise.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:31.650
And what a <i>splendid</i> somersault!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.590
Falulu, I have nothing left to teach to you-glo.

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:38.120
By contrast...

00:08:39.940 --> 00:08:44.750
You aren't allowed to leave the gym before I allow you to-glo!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.500
Whaaat?!

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:52.470
I'll tell Hime and the rest of you's families I'm taking care of you for a while-glo.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:56.930
And I'll personally handle your schoolwork,
so there's no problem at all-glo.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.140
No way!

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:03.100
Quiet! If you want to win,
stop complaining and start Gloxercising!

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:05.060
Glo...

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.660
Are you guys okay?

00:09:24.070 --> 00:09:25.860
Guess not.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:30.340
I just came 'cause Leona was worried and said we should...

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:33.550
You're seriously about 300 million years away from pulling off a somersault!

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:36.050
Maybe we'll never pull it off...

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:37.000
Dagnabbit, Kuma!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.510
Why'd you recommend this place to us-pri?

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:45.280
Cease your whining. Our rivals couldn't possibly perish in a place like this!

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:49.800
Second Wind! You must believe in your comeback!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.690
Sponge whinge.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.400
I did have something for you.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.990
Here, pizza from Lala's dad.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:05.830
Thanks Leona! It's been too long since I had this.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.000
Don't mind if I d—uh?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.960
Bringing your own food is strictly against the rules-glo!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.370
Your punishment is 5 hours of Gloxercise!

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:21.080
Worse than the school rules-pri...

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.250
Lady Sophie, we've brought you something.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.060
Chanko.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.240
Please look inside.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:38.640
With Red Flash you'll be unstoppable, Lady Sophie!

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:41.540
Please have some so at least you'll get out of here!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:42.450
Lady Sophie!

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:49.080
Chanko?

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:50.550
I'll be fine.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.460
Lady Sophie, kick some butt!

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.970
Chanko!

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.530
Somersault...

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.850
I want out-pri—

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:10.340
Owie...

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.020
Huh? Sophie's gone-pri.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:16.030
For real?

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.300
She's not here!

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.620
Could she have run away because the training was too much?

00:11:21.620 --> 00:11:22.870
No way!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:26.460
This could be bad-pri! Let's go find her-pri!

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:27.330
Capisce!

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:45.970
What are you doing?

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.760
Training.

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:54.230
They said I should focus on lower-body strength before I can do a somersault.

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:07.580
When will you be able to do a somersault?

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:13.920
When I can pull this thing to the moon!

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:15.870
Isn't that impossible?

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:26.550
I was a baby until just now.

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:32.750
But Unicorn taught me everything about PriPara.

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:37.720
How stage performances are set up, tips for ranking up, fashion...

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:41.490
The strengths and quirks of other famous idols.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:49.950
Unicorn says I'll definitely be the one to win ParaPri and get the Paradise Coord.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:54.420
That's why I think it won't matter how hard you train.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:59.340
Oh, Sophie!

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.440
Are you going to give up?

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:11.110
I'm not giving up!

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:12.100
Huh?

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.850
Sophie!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:17.170
I'm not giving up... Because...

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:20.770
I have my friends with me.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.030
Sophie...

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:27.740
Friends... Is that like "French"?

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:34.200
Yeah. I think they'll be happy when they hear I can do a somersault.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.960
Go, Sophie!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.380
Just a little more-pri!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.720
It moved!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.430
It moved? Just a little...

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.430
Sophie!

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:55.650
Sophie... Sorry I doubted you-pri.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.130
Me too, Sophie.

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:00.150
I'll never give up as long as I'm with you two!

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.110
Let's laugh our way to victory!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.090
Yes.

00:14:04.090 --> 00:14:04.820
Pri!

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:17.410
It's way past bedtime, you lot!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.380
What are you doing out here at this hour-glo?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:21.880
U-Uh...

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.340
We... Were just planning how we'll start working harder-pri!

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:29.760
Really? You're that eager to train?

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.150
Very well.

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:37.040
Then, I shall put your training to a special test right now-glo!

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:52.630
You'll receive 100 serves from me.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:58.190
If you manage to hit even one of the serves, you pass!

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:01.090
You'll be free to leave immediately.

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:03.120
But should you fail...

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:08.170
Your sentence will be extended to three years!

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.840
Love All!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.220
15!

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:17.850
30!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:20.060
40!

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.980
Winner: Love!

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:25.920
We won't be able to...

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.920
go to ParaPri!

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.210
Second game!

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.040
I won't give up-pri!

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:39.500
Right!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.790
I'll become a jelly with backbone!

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:47.920
Ball 100! Love - 40!

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:52.720
Sophie!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.140
Gotcha!

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:59.350
Capisce receive!

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.660
We did it! Home run!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.740
Happy New Year!

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.200
Winner: SoLaMi SMILE.

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.670
Hooray!

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:18.510
Hooray-pri!

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:20.650
Bravo!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:29.080
If the whole team pulls together, you'll find power that surpasses your physical and mental limits.

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:34.130
I knew you would arrive at this answer.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.600
Headmistress...

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.550
Now, go!

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.560
Somersaults or not,

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:49.670
I'm certain your new performance will be wonderful-glo!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.380
Glo!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:57.200
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:01.150
You may also scan Friend Tickets.

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:04.000
Coord Change Start!

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:09.810
Today we have a color change to match the old 3-person setup.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:12.190
Lala's going with a refreshing blue.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.220
Wish Ribbon Idol Coord!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.310
And Mireille's is brilliantly yellow like the sun.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.630
The blue highlights work wonders on that.

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.980
Wish Ribbon Idol Coord!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:28.320
Pri!

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:33.760
And here's a surprise! Sophie's changing to pink!

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:36.610
Show us the results of that special training!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.740
Wish Ribbon Idol Coord!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:02.490
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.630
Twinkle!

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.140
Twinkle twink!

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:12.460
Twinkle twinkle!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.180
Twinkle twinkle twinkle!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:22.830
Night Sky...

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:28.530
Moonlight Traveling!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.770
Cyalume Change!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.580
Lovely!

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:13.810
Perfect-glo!

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:17.810
Well done-kuma!

00:20:17.810 --> 00:20:21.320
The PriPara Gym cleared out any and all doubt.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:22.490
Yes, yes...

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:25.990
That new Making Drama is amazing!

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.280
Not bad for them.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.950
Opponents or not, splendidly done!

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:30.780
Marvelous, Lady Sophie!

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:32.450
Chanko!

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.770
Thank you!

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.650
Friends...

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.300
Yay! That went great!

00:20:43.300 --> 00:20:48.340
We'll have no trouble winning ParaPri next week like this!

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:49.220
Yeah!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:58.030
I have nothing left to teach you.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:20:59.650
You've done a great job until now!

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.950
Hey, Unicorn...

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.700
I'll answer any questions you have.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.630
What is "friends"?

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:07.570
Huh?

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:11.620
Is it something tasty? Or something strong?

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.840
Or is it...

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:14.290
Good grief...

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:18.270
Where did you pick up such a pointless word?

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:21.970
Listen here. Idols have no need for "friends"!

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:23.260
All you need is fans!

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:25.970
Don't worry.

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:31.430
Do as I say and you'll keep getting more and more fans!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.550
'kay!

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:09.190
It's finally time for the last ParaPri!

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:12.870
If we win, we'll get every piece of Paradise Coord-pri!

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:16.830
Balderdash! Dressing Pafé will win.

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:19.290
