00:23:19.610 --> 00:23:21.750
But Unicorn said

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:24.250
"Falulu was born to be at the top."

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:26.670
How were you born, anyway, Falulu?

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:28.600
What's your secret?

00:23:28.600 --> 00:23:32.670
Next time: Excitement! Who Will Claim The Paradise Coord!?

00:23:32.670 --> 00:23:35.820
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
